OL,3,AMeta agrees to pay up to $17.1bn to
OL,4,Asettle social media case
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media giant Meta has reached a
OL,7,Fsettlement with US states and
OL,8,Fterritories to resolve a court case
OL,9,Frelated to child safety on Facebook and
OL,10,FInstagram.
OL,12,FThe tech company will pay a maximum of
OL,13,F$16.68bn (#12.26bn), according to court
OL,14,Fdocuments.
OL,16,FThe settlement requires Meta introduce
OL,17,Fcertain rules for teenage users,
OL,18,Fincluding daily limits and night-time
OL,19,Fblocks.
OL,21,FMeta denied wrongdoing in agreeing to
OL,22,Fsettle.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
